# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing generated belongs in git. Every path below is reproducible from the
# scripts that are in git, and most of it is enormous.
#
#   as-text-model/data/raw          117 MB  -> python data/collect.py
#   as-text-model/data/processed     43 MB  -> python data/prepare.py
#   as-text-model/checkpoints       486 MB  -> python train.py / finetune.py
#   as-image-model/data/emoji_src    55 MB  -> curl, see as-image-model/README
#   as-image-model/data/emoji       585 MB  -> python data/emoji.py
#   as-image-model/data/shapes      516 MB  -> python data/shapes.py
#
# Publish the corpus and the models to Hugging Face instead — see README.
#
# Note: patterns containing a slash are anchored to this file's directory, so
# the corpus rules below must name as-text-model/ explicitly. The single-name
# rules (checkpoints/, logs/, __pycache__/) match at any depth and don't.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# python
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# scraped + generated corpora
as-text-model/data/raw/*
!as-text-model/data/raw/tiny.txt
as-text-model/data/raw_v0/
as-text-model/data/processed/
as-text-model/data/persona/
as-text-model/data/stage2/

# Rendered corpora and the upstream artwork they are built from.
#
# Every DIRECTORY under as-image-model/data/ is generated — the only things
# worth keeping there are the .py files that regenerate them. Naming datasets
# one by one is how 593 MB of emoji300/ renders got staged the moment a new
# corpus appeared; this rule covers whatever gets added next.
as-image-model/data/*/

# AS-IF: exported + quantized diffusion builds, several GB each.
# Wildcarded for the same reason as data/ above — asif_small/ appeared later
# and a rule naming only asif_build/ silently staged it.
as-image-model/asif_*/

# trained models and exports
checkpoints/
onnx_build/
*.pt
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.onnx_data

# run output
logs/
*.log
as-image-model/*.png
# ...but the curated sheets shown in the README are committed on purpose
!as-image-model/samples/*.png

# hugging face / local caches
.cache/
hf_cache/

# os / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
